{"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Download-the-SDK","level":2,"text":"Download the SDK","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioningExtension.xcframework","│   ├── CardSessions.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"syntax":"text","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Required-Frameworks","level":2,"text":"Required Frameworks","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning-Sessions-Approach","level":3,"text":"Network Token Provisioning (Sessions Approach)","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following framework is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"required"}]},{"text":" for the sessions-based provisioning:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Framework"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Purpose"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Session-based provisioning logic and public API"}]}]]],"type"